43:  * The record set is module state and therefore spans every Cordis runtime in
44:  * the process; a reader that serves one runtime passes that runtime's root
45:  * fiber so another runtime mounting the same preset id (a second embedded
46:  * app, a test's second harness) never answers for it.
47:  * @param within - when present, only mounts inside this fiber's subtree.
48:  * @returns the live mounts.
